1459	/// The floating ruler band: adaptive ticks, the in/out shading, the marker
1460	/// flags and the playhead's coral head (spec §4.4).
1461	///
1462	/// Its frame's x is always 0 and its width the whole content, so its local x
1463	/// IS content x and every tick can be placed straight from the layout. Only
1464	/// its y floats. It refuses hits so `TimelineContentView` owns the mouse; the
1465	/// one exception is a real subview, which is how the inline rename field
1466	/// still works.
1467	final class TimelineRulerView: NSView {
